WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.601
- Guys, it is Tuesday.
It's time for WeTweet.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:03.567
Here we go, everybody.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:06.901
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:09.734
♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:11.367
-Welcome to WeTweet.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:14.167
This is where we --
we as a group,

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:16.567
decide something
that we should post on Twitter.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:18.501
I'm going to show you
five different tweets,

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:19.534
and we're all going to vote on

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:21.133
whether you like each one
or not.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:23.000
Y'all have voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.367
It's the biggest and the highest
in technology, right there.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:26.767
Yeah. You can vote for them.

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:29.133
The green says you like it,
red says you don't like it.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:30.767
Or you don't have to vote

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.534
if you feel like just
sitting back and relaxing.

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.334
It's up to you. We're going to
see the results live.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.067
And, Higgins, Roots,
do you have clickers too?

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.033
-Got it.
-And whatever tweet gets

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.534
the most likes,
we're going to tweet it out

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:43.601
live during the show so that you
can all like it and WeTweet it.

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.534
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:48.400
Alright, here we go.
You guys ready for this?

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:53.834
And remember, no standing
ovations in any of these.

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:55.467
-Really?
-Yeah, you just either

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.734
like them, you press them.

00:00:56.734 --> 00:00:59.000
You can laugh.
Yeah, we like audible.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.834
We like to hear
you laughing as Well --

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:03.534
-But don't stand up.
-Now we just heard

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:04.734
from the judges,
you're allowed to stand up.

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.000
-Oh, okay.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.901
Okay, the first tweet is...

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.901
♪♪

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:16.534
"Uh, sir. Sir, could you please
put your shirt on and...?"

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:21.267
"I appreciate that respect."

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:23.133
Here we go.
The results are in.

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:24.234
Let's see the votes.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.734
No. No.
Didn't like it at all.

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:30.334
People were upset.
That upset people.

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:31.934
-Yeah.
-That bummed people out.

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:34.567
"Sir, I'm going to have to ask
you to leave for not voting."

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.601
Alright,
this next one here says...

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:43.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:45.534
♪♪

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:46.968
Stop looking at me.

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.000
♪♪

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.067
Alright.

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.667
Let's see the results
on this one.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:54.067
I think it's going to be better
than the first one.

00:01:54.067 --> 00:01:55.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
There you go!

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.567
That's the one. That's it.

00:01:57.567 --> 00:02:00.501
Almost -- Almost got
one standing ovation.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:02.200
-Really?
-One girl almost stood up.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.200
-Almost stood up.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.000
-She stopped herself
halfway through.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.200
Yep. Alright.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.367
How about this next one here?
It says...

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.501
[ Laughter ]
-Ha!

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:19.267
♪♪

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:20.868
-Deep cut.
-That's a deep cut.

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.067
That's for the deejays
out there.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:25.267
Alright, I think --
-I think it's a good one.

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:27.367
-Yeah. But can it beat --
-No.

00:02:27.367 --> 00:02:29.133
-No, I don't think
it's going to beat 157.

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:30.667
Quest, you don't think so,
right?

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.234
-It's good, though.
-It's good though, yeah.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.467
Let's see the results.

00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:37.100
Oh, wow!
-Wow.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.968
Wow!
-Wow. Shocking.

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:41.834
-88 and full of hate.
-It got a sit--

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.667
sitting ovation, that one.
-Wow.

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.801
-Let's try the next one.
It says...

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:55.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.767
-Wow, that almost got one.

00:02:56.767 --> 00:02:58.200
-Yeah. I think so.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.167
-Acai!
-Can I vote twice?

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:01.667
Acai!

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:02.567
[ To tune of
"Dragostea Din Tei" ]

00:03:02.567 --> 00:03:05.534
♪ Aca-ee, aca-eye ♪

00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:09.200
♪ Aya-ee, aya-ah-ha ♪

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.267
