00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.167
Acai, let's see the results.

00:03:14.534 --> 00:03:17.000
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.200
[ Cheers and applause ]
-[ Cheering, laughing ]

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.868
♪♪

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:27.300
-Oh, my goodness!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.601
Wow.
-Yeah.

00:03:28.601 --> 00:03:29.901
Why would we even do
another one?

00:03:29.901 --> 00:03:31.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:32.634
You won't get better than that.

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:34.167
-We're not going to get --
we might.

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:36.100
-Well, we could get
much lower than the first.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:39.701
-That's true.
-Let's see how low we can go.

00:03:39.701 --> 00:03:40.834
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:42.267
Let's see
if the red clickers work,

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:43.734
