think that we did this.

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:07.434
But I would never do that.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.434 --> 00:04:09.767
-We could also edit in some
standing ovations too.

00:04:09.767 --> 00:04:12.467
-Yeah. No, there hasn't been
one standing ovation at all.

00:04:12.467 --> 00:04:14.200
We could vote "no" on this, and
then have a standing ovation.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.200
-Vote "no" and standing ovation.
Yes!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.400
-Alright. This might happen.
This has never happened.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.300
We get zero of the votes, so
either don't vote or vote red.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.367
-Right.

00:04:24.367 --> 00:04:27.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:30.667
-Why are we going this?
-Keep it interesting.

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:31.934
-Last one is...

00:04:36.834 --> 00:04:39.000
♪♪

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.968
-Oh, the humanity.

00:04:40.968 --> 00:04:43.334
♪♪

00:04:43.334 --> 00:04:44.701
Wow.

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:46.000
I don't think
you had to even tell them.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.868
-No, there's a couple people
