00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:53.067
Let's see the results.

00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:54.300
Are we getting a standing ova--

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:56.534
[ Laughter ]
Oh!

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:58.534
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Laughs ] No!

00:04:58.534 --> 00:04:59.868
No! It's no!

00:04:59.868 --> 00:05:01.367
It's not absolutely no.

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:05.767
[ Laughs ]

00:05:05.767 --> 00:05:07.968
I love it.
25 people voted yes.

00:05:07.968 --> 00:05:09.601
There we go. We have a winner!

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.367
It's number four!
The one with acai.

00:05:12.367 --> 00:05:14.367
